 "c": [
  {"i":3854,"t":["actions"],"n":"Hiding oneself is an everyday action; position and movement are only loose associations."},
  {"i":3858,"t":["work"],"n":"Success is taught with work and careers; qualities is too loose."},
  {"i":3860,"t":["qualities","time"],"s":{"2":["feelings"]},"n":"The main sense is margin or room (時間の余裕, お金の余裕). Composure is a different, feelings sense, so it gets a sense entry."},
  {"i":3864,"t":["home"],"n":"A wall is part of the house. The obstacle sense is a metaphor and does not belong in a qualities unit."},
  {"i":3881,"t":["qualities","actions"],"n":"It is a general verb for a broken state, taught paired with 壊す. Home is too narrow, and 'stop working' is already covered without a technology entry."},
  {"i":3967,"t":["nature","qualities"],"s":{"4":["law"]},"n":"Darkness fits nature and qualities. The black-market or illegal sense (闇取引, 闇バイト) is common and belongs to crime."}
